{"path":"/documentation/modeling/mixins/meta","section":"documentation","title":"meta","description":"Documentation for the nnsight Python library","toc":[{"id":"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta","label":"meta","depth":2},{"id":"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.MetaDevice","label":"MetaDevice","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta","label":"Meta","depth":3}],"segments":[{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-module\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-module-name\">meta</span>\n\n\n</h2>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Building a model on the meta device, dispatching real weights only on demand.</p>\n<p>Loading a large model's weights is slow and memory-hungry, but most of what\nnnsight needs to plan a trace — the module tree and the shapes that flow through\nit — is fixed by the model's <em>structure</em>, not its weights. So a model is built\nlazily: every module is constructed on the <em>meta</em> device, which records a\ntensor's shape and dtype but allocates no storage. The envoy tree, <code>scan</code>,\nand remote-key resolution all work against this weightless skeleton.</p>\n<p><a title=\"            MetaDevice\" href=\"#nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.MetaDevice\"><code>MetaDevice</code></a> is the mechanism — a torch function mode that forces every\ntensor created (or moved) within it onto meta, however it was created.\n<a title=\"            Meta\" href=\"#nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta\"><code>Meta</code></a> is the policy — it does the meta build up front and <em>dispatches</em>\n(loads real weights and swaps them into the same envoy tree) the first time the\nmodel actually has to run.</p>\n<p>.. code-block:: python</p>"},{"type":"code","lang":"text","code":"model = TransformersModel(\"openai-community/gpt2\")  # meta build, no weights\nmodel.scan(\"Hello\")           # inspect shapes, still no weights\nwith model.trace(\"Hello\"):    # dispatches real weights on first run\n    ..."},{"type":"html","html":"<p>The meta build reconstructs structure only, so a subclass's <code>Meta._load_meta</code>\ndrops weight- and placement-related kwargs (<code>device_map</code>, <code>max_memory</code>, ...):\nthey mean nothing on storageless meta tensors and take effect only at dispatch.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.MetaDevice\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">MetaDevice</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p class=\"doc-class-bases\">\n              Bases: <code><span title=\"torch.overrides.TorchFunctionMode\">TorchFunctionMode</span></code></p>\n\n\n\n        <p>Force every tensor created within the context onto the meta device.</p>\n<p>Setting a default device only covers factory calls that omit <code>device=</code>;\nthis also rewrites explicit <code>device=</code> arguments, so tensors land on meta\nno matter how they are created.</p>\n<p><a title=\"            real\n\n\n  \n      classmethod\n  \" href=\"#nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.MetaDevice.real\"><code>real</code></a> opens a nested window where this forcing is suspended, for the\nparts of a lazy build that need genuine tensors (e.g. a component whose\nconstructor moves a buffer with <code>.to(...)</code>, which a meta tensor can't do).</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.MetaDevice.__enter__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__enter__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__enter__() -> MetaDevice"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.MetaDevice.__exit__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__exit__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__exit__(*exc: Any) -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.MetaDevice.__torch_function__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__torch_function__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__torch_function__(func, types, args=(), kwargs=None)"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.MetaDevice.real\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">real</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-classmethod\"><code>classmethod</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"real() -> Iterator[None]"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Suspend meta-forcing within this block so tensors are created for real.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">Meta</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"Meta(*args: Any, dispatch: bool = False, **kwargs: Any)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p class=\"doc-class-bases\">\n              Bases: <code><a title=\"            Loadable (nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable.Loadable)\" href=\"/documentation/modeling/mixins/loadable#nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable.Loadable\">Loadable</a></code></p>\n\n\n\n        <p>A model wrapper that builds on meta and dispatches real weights on demand.</p>\n<p>Extends <a title=\"            Loadable\" href=\"/documentation/modeling/mixins/loadable#nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable.Loadable\"><code>Loadable</code></a> with a two-phase\nbuild: <code>_load_meta</code> constructs the weightless skeleton up front, and\n<a title=\"            dispatch\" href=\"#nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta.dispatch\"><code>dispatch</code></a> (triggered on the first <code>interleave</code> that isn't a scan)\nloads real weights via <code>_load</code> and swaps them into the existing envoy tree.\nPassing a ready module, or <code>dispatch=True</code>, skips the meta phase and loads\neagerly.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta.dispatched\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">dispatched</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"dispatched = False"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta.args\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">args</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"args = args"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta.kwargs\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">kwargs</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"kwargs = load_kwargs"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta.dispatch\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">dispatch</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"dispatch() -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Load real weights via <code>_load</code> and swap them into the envoy tree.</p>\n<p>Idempotent — a no-op once dispatched. Triggered automatically on the first\nreal (non-scan) <code>interleave</code>; call it directly to load eagerly.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta.scan\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">scan</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"scan(*args: Any, fn: Any = None, backend: Any = None, **kwargs: Any) -> ScanningTracer"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Inspect activation shapes without loading real weights or computing.</p>\n<p>Just like <a title=\"            trace\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/envoy#nnsight.intervention.envoy.Envoy.trace\"><code>trace</code></a>, but the forward\nruns under a fake-tensor mode so only tensor metadata (shapes, dtypes)\npropagates — the model is never dispatched, so this works on a\nmeta-initialized model with no weights in memory:</p>"},{"type":"code","lang":"text","code":">>> model = TransformersModel(\"openai-community/gpt2\")  # not dispatched\n>>> with model.scan(\"Hello World\"):\n...     hidden = model.transformer.h[0].output.shape\n>>> print(hidden)  # torch.Size([...])"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>The values read inside the block are fake tensors valid only within it;\nread their <code>.shape</code> / <code>.dtype</code> here rather than saving the tensor out.</p>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">PARAMETER</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>*args</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>Inputs to scan, forwarded to the model's forward pass.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Any\">Any</span></code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>()</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>fn</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>Method to run, resolved against the module. Defaults to <code>__call__</code>.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Any\">Any</span></code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>None</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>backend</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>Backend that runs the captured block. Defaults to in place.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Any\">Any</span></code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>None</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>**kwargs</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>Keyword inputs forwarded to the forward pass.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Any\">Any</span></code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>{}</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">RETURNS</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <span class=\"doc-returns-annotation\">\n                    <code><a title=\"            ScanningTracer (nnsight.intervention.tracer.ScanningTracer)\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/tracer#nnsight.intervention.tracer.ScanningTracer\">ScanningTracer</a></code>\n                </span>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-returns-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>A <a title=\"            ScanningTracer\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/tracer#nnsight.intervention.tracer.ScanningTracer\"><code>ScanningTracer</code></a> for this model.</p>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta.interleave\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">interleave</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"interleave(fn: Callable, *args: Any, **kwargs: Any) -> Any"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.meta.Meta.__setstate__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__setstate__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__setstate__(state)"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"}]}